    "ImageDescription": {
      "value": "On Sunday, May 24, 2026, Minister of Information and Broadcasting Zahir Uddin Swapan delivered the chief guest's address at a training session held in the conference room of the Department of Information at the Secretariat in Dhaka. The session, titled 'Implementation of Electoral Manifesto and Action Plan,' was attended by Public Relations Officers from various ministries and officers of grade 9 and above from the Department of Information. State Minister for Information Yaser Khan Chowdhury was also present during the event.<abbr title='This English description has been automatically translated from the above Bangla description. If it is incorrect, please edit this page to correct it and remove the \"Auto-translated PID English description\" template.'><span class=\"skin-invert\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Dotted_info_icon.svg/20px-Dotted_info_icon.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Dotted_info_icon.svg/40px-Dotted_info_icon.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"75\" data-file-height=\"77\"></span></span></abbr>",
